    - target: {fileID: 9070986682265164292, guid: 5544226b037396441bbf3325159d66b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\tSoooo, the food problem, right? Today Giovanni said he has a solution
        for us. And that's where things got disgusting.\n\r\n\tHe analized the alien
        samples and said that the smallest species - the one StEVEN called \"Charger\"
        - is actually edible. Maybe not all of it, but some parts for sure. You can
        see where it leads, right?\n\r\n\tI guess there is no other way. The synthfarms
        are still far from being operational, and the colony has to eat something.
        But a single thought about this raw, slimy alien meat makes me wanna puke."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9070986682265164292, guid: 5544226b037396441bbf3325159d66b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 16.65
